Concurrent users = How many people are actively using the application during the time range, if 10 users active between 9 to 9:05 then 10 Concurrent users.
Simeltaneous users - How many users are try login at the same time ie 9 am exactly if 10 clicked then 10 simaltenous users.
Sessions = How many login states the application is maintaining. - Like 10 users logged in and have session created so 10 session, if one logged out then 9 session.
Connections = How many network conversations are happening right now. - If 10 users logged in then 10 tcp connection created after sometime if 8 were reading report and only 2 activly clcking something so network call established and tcp connection open , so 2 active connection.

| Situation                                            | Concurrent Users | Sessions |         Connections |
| ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------: | -------: | ------------------: |
| 10 users all logged in and actively requesting pages |               10 |       10 | Around 10 (or more) |
| 10 users logged in but reading reports               |               10 |       10 |                 0–2 |
| 10 users, 2 sessions expired and being recreated     |               10 |        8 |                 1–2 |
| 1 user loading a complex dashboard                   |                1 |        1 |                5–10 |



