| Column | Simple meaning                 | Performance concern                    |
| ------ | ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |
| `r`    | Tasks waiting/runnable for CPU | High → CPU contention                  |
| `b`    | Tasks blocked                  | High → possible I/O/resource problem   |
| `si`   | Swap → RAM                     | High → memory pressure                 |
| `so`   | RAM → Swap                     | High → memory pressure                 |
| `bi`   | Data read from storage         | High → investigate I/O                 |
| `bo`   | Data written to storage        | High → investigate I/O                 |
| `cs`   | Context switches               | Very high + CPU pressure → investigate |
| `us`   | User/application CPU           | High → application CPU usage           |
| `sy`   | Kernel CPU                     | High → kernel/network/system work      |
| `wa`   | I/O wait                       | High → investigate storage/I/O         |

